IMAPAccount main-gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
User tmarjeski@gmail.com
PassCmd "/home/trev/.local/bin/mail-authinfo-password imap.gmail.com tmarjeski@gmail.com"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore main-remote
Account main-gmail

MaildirStore main-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/Mail/main/
Inbox ~/Mail/main/INBOX

Channel main
Far :main-remote:
Near :main-local:
Patterns "INBOX" "[Gmail]/Sent Mail" "[Gmail]/Trash"
Create Near
Expunge Both
SyncState *

IMAPAccount lists-gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
User tarjeski@gmail.com
PassCmd "/home/trev/.local/bin/mail-authinfo-password imap.gmail.com tarjeski@gmail.com"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore lists-remote
Account lists-gmail

MaildirStore lists-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/Mail/lists/
Inbox ~/Mail/lists/INBOX

Channel lists
Far :lists-remote:
Near :lists-local:
Patterns "INBOX" "[Gmail]/Sent Mail" "[Gmail]/Trash"
Create Near
Expunge Both
SyncState *

Group mail
Channel main
Channel lists
